  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "8226912",
      "title": "Shuffling Answers & Adding Quiz Logic",
      "sourceHash": "fbdc9d3ace815727bf81aaaa409240013ad0ec84d686fa94d0bb41f99d88e0df",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.57,
          "end": 3.59,
          "en": "So, now that we can display questions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.59,
          "end": 6.8,
          "en": "and register answers, I wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.8,
          "end": 10.47,
          "en": "that we do actually shuffle those answers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.47,
          "end": 14.07,
          "en": "so that they're not always presented in the same order",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.07,
          "end": 17.37,
          "en": "and it's always the first answer that's correct.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.37,
          "end": 21.24,
          "en": "And I wanna make sure that once we exhausted all questions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.24,
          "end": 24.06,
          "en": "we don't break the app with an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.06,
          "end": 26.823,
          "en": "but we instead show some summary screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.9,
          "end": 31.98,
          "en": "Now, I wanna start by shuffling those answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.98,
          "end": 36.3,
          "en": "To do that, we can go to this Quiz JSX file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.3,
          "end": 41.3,
          "en": "and in there we could now add a shuffledAnswers constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 43.11,
          "end": 47.76,
          "en": "where we simply start by creating a new array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 47.76,
          "end": 51.75,
          "en": "And we then spread those question answers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 51.75,
          "end": 55.47,
          "en": "for the selected question into this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 55.47,
          "end": 59.52,
          "en": "So, this QUESTIONS[activeQuestionIndex].answers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 59.52,
          "end": 63.003,
          "en": "data piece here, we spread that into this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 64.44,
          "end": 68.37,
          "en": "Once we did that, we can use shuffledAnswers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 68.37,
          "end": 71.253,
          "en": "and call the built-in sort method on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 73.02,
          "end": 76.44,
          "en": "And sort will not return a new array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 76.44,
          "end": 78.69,
          "en": "but instead edit the array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 78.69,
          "end": 82.47,
          "en": "so the shuffledAnswers array here on which you call it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 82.47,
          "end": 85.26,
          "en": "And that's why I'm creating a new array here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 85.26,
          "end": 89.55,
          "en": "so that I don't edit the original answers array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 89.55,
          "end": 92.43,
          "en": "which I wanna keep in the order it is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 92.43,
          "end": 94.59,
          "en": "because there I know that it's always",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 94.59,
          "end": 97.14,
          "en": "the first answer that's correct.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 97.14,
          "end": 101.67,
          "en": "And I need that information to then dynamically validate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 101.67,
          "end": 104.85,
          "en": "whether the user picked the right answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 104.85,
          "end": 107.75999999999999,
          "en": "So I don't want to edit this array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 107.75999999999999,
          "end": 110.00999999999999,
          "en": "but instead I want to edit a new array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 110.00999999999999,
          "end": 112.38,
          "en": "and that's what I'm doing here by creating a copy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 112.38,
          "end": 114.42,
          "en": "and then calling sort.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 114.42,
          "end": 118.5,
          "en": "And sort then takes a function, which in theory",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 118.5,
          "end": 122.01,
          "en": "always receives two elements from this array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 122.01,
          "end": 123.84,
          "en": "on which you're calling it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 123.84,
          "end": 126.66,
          "en": "And if you're then returning a negative number here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 126.66,
          "end": 128.28,
          "en": "those elements will be swapped.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.28,
          "end": 130.17,
          "en": "If you're returning a positive number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 130.17,
          "end": 132.66,
          "en": "they will stay in the order they are.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 132.66,
          "end": 135.78,
          "en": "And sort will then simply go through all the elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 135.78,
          "end": 140.613,
          "en": "pair by pair in this array to derive a new order.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 141.72,
          "end": 144.57,
          "en": "Now, I actually don't care about the inputs here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 144.57,
          "end": 146.85,
          "en": "because I wanna shuffle the order here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.85,
          "end": 148.11,
          "en": "And we can achieve this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 148.11,
          "end": 151.81,
          "en": "by simply calling Math.random() - 0.5",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 152.88,
          "end": 155.34,
          "en": "because Math.random will give us a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 155.34,
          "end": 158.88,
          "en": "between zero and 1, 1 excluded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.88,
          "end": 161.88,
          "en": "And if we deduct 0.5 from that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 161.88,
          "end": 166.88,
          "en": "we will end up with a negative value in 50 of 100 cases",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 167.13,
          "end": 169.71,
          "en": "or with a positive value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.71,
          "end": 172.623,
          "en": "And that should therefore shuffle those answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 174.84,
          "end": 177.42000000000002,
          "en": "And therefore, it's then those shuffled answers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 177.42000000000002,
          "end": 179.49,
          "en": "which I wanna output down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.49,
          "end": 182.883,
          "en": "instead of those standard default answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.89,
          "end": 187.89,
          "en": "With that, if we reload, you should see that the order",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 187.89,
          "end": 192.873,
          "en": "of those answers is different every time this does reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 195.66,
          "end": 198.06,
          "en": "And that's therefore the first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 198.06,
          "end": 202.65,
          "en": "And I'll say right away that this is not fully finished yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 202.65,
          "end": 204.87,
          "en": "We'll have to tweak it a little bit later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 204.87,
          "end": 207.213,
          "en": "but the core logic is correct.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 208.2,
          "end": 210.57,
          "en": "But before we'll tweak it, I wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 210.57,
          "end": 214.14,
          "en": "that we don't break this application and quiz",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.14,
          "end": 219,
          "en": "if we answer too many questions as is currently the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 219,
          "end": 221.594,
          "en": "And to make sure that we don't break it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 221.594,
          "end": 225.84300000000002,
          "en": "we have to find out whether the quiz is over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 226.74,
          "end": 230.7,
          "en": "And that can be another computed value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 230.7,
          "end": 234.06,
          "en": "because the quiz will be over if we registered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 234.06,
          "end": 238.143,
          "en": "as many user answers as we have questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 239.28,
          "end": 242.67,
          "en": "So, we can add another new computed value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 242.67,
          "end": 245.4,
          "en": "a new constant here, which could be called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 245.4,
          "end": 250.23,
          "en": "quizIsComplete or something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 250.23,
          "end": 254.88,
          "en": "And this should be true if the activeQuestionIndex",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 254.88,
          "end": 259.88,
          "en": "is equal to QUESTIONS.length like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 260.85,
          "end": 263.04,
          "en": "and false otherwise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 263.04,
          "end": 266.76,
          "en": "So with this check, we make sure that we can't exceed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 266.76,
          "end": 268.683,
          "en": "the number of questions we have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 270.27,
          "end": 275.01,
          "en": "And now, we just need to display some different content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 275.01,
          "end": 279.63,
          "en": "and not this quiz content here if the quiz is over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 279.63,
          "end": 283.26,
          "en": "So, if we did go through all questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 283.26,
          "end": 285.93,
          "en": "And for that, we can of course add a if check here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 285.93,
          "end": 287.493,
          "en": "and check if quizIsComplete,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 288.99,
          "end": 291.631,
          "en": "and if that's the case, I want to return,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 291.631,
          "end": 295.203,
          "en": "let's say a div with an id \"summary\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 296.15999999999997,
          "end": 299.01,
          "en": "and in there we could output a h2 element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 299.01,
          "end": 303.27,
          "en": "where we say Quiz Completed!",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 303.27,
          "end": 306.45,
          "en": "And maybe also some image above it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 306.45,
          "end": 309.99,
          "en": "which I will import into this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 309.99,
          "end": 314.67,
          "en": "And here I wanna import this quiz-complete PNG file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 314.67,
          "end": 319.41,
          "en": "So therefore here it's this quizCompleteImage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 319.41,
          "end": 321.99,
          "en": "imported from going up one level,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 321.99,
          "end": 326.703,
          "en": "diving into assets, and then quiz-complete. png.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 328.44,
          "end": 330.69,
          "en": "And now it's this image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 330.69,
          "end": 335.22,
          "en": "which should be output down there as a source.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 335.22,
          "end": 337.98,
          "en": "And the alt text could be \"Trophy icon\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 337.98,
          "end": 340.83299999999997,
          "en": "because that's what's being displayed on that image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 342.57,
          "end": 346.14,
          "en": "And if you now save this, you should be able to reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 346.14,
          "end": 348.06,
          "en": "go through these questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 348.06,
          "end": 353.06,
          "en": "And once you went through all questions, it crashes again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 354.15,
          "end": 357.64300000000003,
          "en": "And that happens because we do indeed check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 357.64300000000003,
          "end": 359.37,
          "en": "if the quizIsComplete,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 359.37,
          "end": 362.49,
          "en": "and then output a different component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 362.49,
          "end": 364.95,
          "en": "But before we do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 364.95,
          "end": 368.94,
          "en": "even before I produce this quizIsComplete value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 368.94,
          "end": 373.56,
          "en": "I'm already trying to access the activeQuestionIndex here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 373.56,
          "end": 376.113,
          "en": "to get my answers, which I wanna shuffle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 377.04,
          "end": 380.25,
          "en": "But this will fail if the quiz is complete",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 380.25,
          "end": 383.073,
          "en": "because we exhausted all questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 384.18,
          "end": 386.34,
          "en": "So therefore, this logic here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 386.34,
          "end": 389.79,
          "en": "should actually come after this if block",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 389.79,
          "end": 393.54,
          "en": "where we return if the quiz is complete,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 393.54,
          "end": 396.312,
          "en": "so that this code here only executes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 396.312,
          "end": 399.603,
          "en": "if we still have a question to display.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 401.64,
          "end": 404.31,
          "en": "And with that change made, if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 404.31,
          "end": 408,
          "en": "now I can go through all those questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 408,
          "end": 410.01,
          "en": "And then, at the end we see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 410.01,
          "end": 413.25,
          "en": "this Quiz Completed screen here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 413.25,
          "end": 415.563,
          "en": "And that's therefore this logic added.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}